the headcount reductions done and what could that mean for margin as we look into the first half of 2019?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q4-2018-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"FNF 2019 Q2","e":"fnf","d":"2019-07-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Campbell","x":"And then on escrow, that looks like, I guess within the escrow, another line looks like escrow might have bounced back a bit, but is that mostly driven by just better -- just the improving purchase market or you've been able to take price there with new products or offerings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/17/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q2-2019-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"FNF 2020 Q1","e":"fnf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond R. Quirk","x":"What we did do is we don't typically have a severance program, but we did pick up COBRA expenses for those people that were reduced for 90 days and hopes that if and when this market is coming back, then we can start bringing people back in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"FNF 2020 Q1","e":"fnf","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Gamaitoni","x":"I wanted to kind of understand the layoffs relative to volume outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q1-2020-earnin.aspx"},{"c":"FNF 2020 Q3","e":"fnf","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Raymond R. Quirk","x":"Chris and his team also had success during the third quarter, streamlining F&G's operations as they entered into an agreement to sell F&G Reinsurance to a Aspida Holdings, a subsidiary of Ares Management Corporation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"FNF 2020 Q3","e":"fnf","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Hughes","x":"And then just a broad question about the technology and the streamlining of the business, it sounds like it certainly helps from a margin standpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/05/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q3-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"FNF 2020 Q4","e":"fnf","d":"2021-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony J. Park","x":"…a $37 million tax benefit related to the sale of F&G Re which had a tax loss, even though it wasn't a GAAP loss and another roughly $40 million of benefits from an F&G restructuring, so about $77 million in total that benefited our adjusted operating earnings, and that's really a one-time deal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/25/fidelity-national-financial-inc-fnf-q4-2020-earnin/"},{"c":"FNF 2025 Q4","e":"fnf","d":"2026-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Nolan","x":"We also expanded our identity verification processes and technology to streamline and secure customer authentication, helping combat the rise in impersonation and wire fraud in property sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/fidelity-national-fnf-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2025 Q4","e":"fnf","d":"2026-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Nolan","x":"We have made significant progress in building AI literacy across the company, and teams are using AI to streamline workflows, increase efficiency, and unlock new ways to better serve our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/20/fidelity-national-fnf-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2026 Q1","e":"fnf","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Joseph Nolan","x":"Beyond our residential volume recovery, the benefits of our continuous investments in technology and AI have the potential to further enhance our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/fnf-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2026 Q1","e":"fnf","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Joseph Nolan","x":"I want to spend a few minutes on AI—what we are doing and what it means for our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/fnf-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2026 Q2","e":"fnf","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mike Nolan","x":"This operational leverage also comes through our technology and AI investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/fnf-fnf-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2026 Q2","e":"fnf","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mike Nolan","x":"We remain well positioned to benefit from continued strength in commercial and an eventual recovery in residential transaction volumes, as well as benefits from our investments in technology, automation and artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/fnf-fnf-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNF 2026 Q3","e":"fnf","d":"2026-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Joseph Nolan","x":"This operational leverage is also supported by the investments we continue to make in technology and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/fidelity-fnf-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,5553,0,0,0,3252,1780],[37,1,5081,0,0,0,4029,610],[38,1,6789,0,0,0,4887,1458],[39,1,5768,0,0,0,4004,1249],[40,1,6214,0,0,0,3927,1760],[41,1,6383,0,0,0,4927,1028],[42,1,5615,0,0,0,4487,846],[43,1,6678,0,0,0,5284,1041],[44,1,6734,0,0,0,5367,1053],[45,1,5809,0,0,0,4634,817],[46,1,5435,0,0,0,4552,553],[47,1,6558,0,0,0,5473,815],[64,1,4888,0,0,0,1634,2990],[65,1,5584,0,0,0,2119,3146],[66,1,5219,0,0,0,4598,398],[67,1,5702,0,0,0,1936,3467]],"cinema":[[36,1,5553,0,0,0,3252,1780],[37,1,5081,0,0,0,4029,610],[38,1,6789,0,0,0,4887,1458],[39,1,5768,0,0,0,4004,1249],[40,1,6214,0,0,0,3927